        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>中小学教师类（D类）</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']] }\n};\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    font-family: \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"Heiti SC\", sans-serif;\n    background-color: #fdf6e6;\n    background-image:\n      linear-gradient(to right, rgba(210,190,150,.35) 1px, transparent 1px),\n      linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(210,190,150,.35) 1px, transparent 1px);\n    background-size: 26px 26px;\n  }\n  .page {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 540px;\n    min-height: 750px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 18px 16px 30px 16px;\n  }\n  /* 外层棕色笔记本封面 */\n  .notebook {\n    position: relative;\n    background: #7a4a2a;\n    border-radius: 18px;\n    padding: 14px 14px 14px 40px;\n    box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.15);\n  }\n  /* 左侧线圈 */\n  .rings {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 10px;\n    top: 40px;\n    bottom: 40px;\n    width: 22px;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n  }\n  .ring {\n    width: 22px;\n    height: 12px;\n    background: #d9534f;\n    border-radius: 6px;\n    opacity: .95;\n  }\n  /* 内页白纸 */\n  .paper {\n    position: relative;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    border-radius: 14px;\n    padding: 58px 22px 26px 22px;\n    min-height: 640px;\n  }\n  /* 标题红色标签 */\n  .title-tag {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: -30px;\n    left: 12px;\n    right: 22px;\n    background: #d94a52;\n    color: #fff;\n    border-radius: 10px;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 27px;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n    padding: 12px 6px;\n    box-shadow: 0 3px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.08);\n  }\n  /* 右侧便签贴纸 */\n  .sticky {\n    position: absolute;\n    right: -6px;\n    width: 26px;\n    border-radius: 4px;\n  }\n  .sticky.pink { top: 120px; height: 70px; background: #f5a6b0; }\n  .sticky.yellow { top: 200px; height: 60px; background: #f7d774; }\n  .sticky.blue { top: 268px; height: 55px; background: #a9d4e8; }\n\n  /* 左上黄色小夹子占位 */\n  .clip {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 66px;\n    left: 46px;\n    width: 26px;\n    height: 22px;\n    background: #f6c445;\n    transform: rotate(-18deg);\n    border-radius: 3px;\n  }\n\n  h2.section {\n    font-size: 16px;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    margin: 6px 0 8px 0;\n    color: #111;\n  }\n  p.body {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 2.0;\n    margin: 0 0 10px 0;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n  }\n  .item {\n    position: relative;\n    padding-left: 20px;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 2.0;\n    margin: 0 0 10px 0;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n  }\n  .item::before {\n    content: \"\";\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 0;\n    top: 10px;\n    width: 0;\n    height: 0;\n    border-left: 12px solid #e03a2f;\n    border-top: 7px solid transparent;\n    border-bottom: 7px solid transparent;\n  }\n  strong { font-weight: 800; }\n  .footnote {\n    text-align: right;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    color: #6b6b6b;\n    margin-top: 14px;\n    padding-right: 4px;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    display: block;\n    border: 1px dashed #bbb;\n    color: #888;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n  <div class=\"notebook\">\n    <div class=\"rings\">\n      <div class=\"ring\"></div>\n      <div class=\"ring\"></div>\n      <div class=\"ring\"></div>\n      <div class=\"ring\"></div>\n      <div class=\"ring\"></div>\n      <div class=\"ring\"></div>\n      <div class=\"ring\"></div>\n      <div class=\"ring\"></div>\n      <div class=\"ring\"></div>\n      <div class=\"ring\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"sticky pink\"></div>\n    <div class=\"sticky yellow\"></div>\n    <div class=\"sticky blue\"></div>\n\n    <div class=\"paper\">\n      <div class=\"title-tag\">中小学教师类（D类）</div>\n      <div class=\"clip\"></div>\n\n      <h2 class=\"section\">（一）科目</h2>\n      <p class=\"body\">教育系统事业单位考试整体来说考试形式为<strong>公共科目+专业知识</strong>。</p>\n\n      <p class=\"item\"><strong>公共科目包括:</strong>教育基础知识:教育学、心理学或教育心理学、教育法律法规、新课改或公共基础知识（事业单位考试中的公基）。心理学与教育心理学并不相同,心理学通常称为普通心理学,教育心理学简称为教心。</p>\n\n      <p class=\"item\"><strong>专业学科:</strong>一般来说一部分考核学科基础知识,另外一部分考核教学知识(教学设计、教学实施、教学评价)。</p>\n\n      <h2 class=\"section\">（二）题型</h2>\n      <p class=\"body\">教育理论知识的题型分为客观题和主观题两大类型。</p>\n\n      <p class=\"item\">客观题主要是指单选题、多选题、不定项选择题、判断题、填空题等;</p>\n\n      <p class=\"item\">主观题主要包括名词解释题、辨析题、简答题、论述题、材料/案例分析题、教学设计题(活动设计题)等。<strong>一般地域不同, 题型也有所区别。</strong></p>\n\n      <div class=\"footnote\">*线上课程面向22岁及以上</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
